   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<img src=\"@img:images/100917a_7yhbupcd.jpg\" alt=\"metal detecting on cleethorpes beach\" title=\"metal detecting on cleethorpes beach\" width=\"278\" height=\"156\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Back on the beaches of Lincolnshire with the <a href=\"@ctx3030/\" data-kind=\"internal\">CTX3030</a> and to say what a jumbled up beach today, Sand had moved in a very small area, old finds new finds all jumbled together, just didnt really have a clue as to what to expect next, lots of old coins, plenty of new coins and a really nice quite rare Death Pendant, and somebody else also found the same one this weekend in a different part of the country, how strange was that. Feel free to <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/subscription_center?add_user=flash1968\" data-kind=\"external\">Comment and subscribe</a> for New Beach metal detecting videos, <a href=\"@beginners-guide-to-metal-detecting/\" data-kind=\"internal\">hints and tips</a>"
  }
 ],
